Well, they're really different sorts of games, even though they look a lot 
alike.  Angband is much more of a standard dungeon crawl, hack and slash
thing.  It's got nifty weapons and spells and such, and lots of nasty monsters.
Nethack is a much more relaxed, fun sort of game.  It has some of the dungeon
crawl elements, but there's also various side quests, and far more effort
has been put into nifty side features rather than new monster abilities.

